    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List - I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List - II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>a</td>\t\t\t<td>Magnetic induction</td>\t\t\t<td>i</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>b</td>\t\t\t<td>Magnetic flux</td>\t\t\t<td>ii</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>c</td>\t\t\t<td>Magnetic permeability</td>\t\t\t<td>iii</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>d</td>\t\t\t<td>Magnetization</td>\t\t\t<td>iv</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>",
